    "eventDetail": "The 2018 Annual ISHA Scientific Meeting will be held in Melbourne, Australia from October 4-6. This will be the 10th Anniversary Meeting of ISHA, and we are planning some special events to mark this achievement. It will also be the first meeting of the newly changed ISHA which will officially include open hip preservation surgery into our name, and open hip preservation surgeons into our great fellowship of friends",
